OL,3,GNEWSAInquest date set for boy, 10,
OL,4,Akilled in coach crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest date has been set for a
OL,7,F10-year-old boy who died in a coach
OL,8,Fcrash while returning from a school
OL,9,Ftrip to the zoo.
OL,11,FOliver Price died when a coach carrying
OL,12,FMinehead Middle School pupils left the
OL,13,Froad near Wheddon Cross in Somerset and
OL,14,Fslid down a 6m (20ft) slope on 17 July
OL,15,F2025.
OL,17,FWells Coroner's Court was previously
OL,18,Ftold Oliver had been found in his seat
OL,19,Fwith his seatbelt on, and was declared
OL,20,Fdead at the scene by paramedics.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
