OL,3,GNEWSAInquest date set for boy, 10,
OL,4,Akilled in coach crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA full inquest by Somerset Coroner's
OL,7,FService is scheduled to take place on
OL,8,F13 November at the Old Municipal
OL,9,FBuildings in Taunton.
